# Damaged install: LABSLOGO.SS corrupt (skips the intro), LB.3DG removed and LB.3DT's two magic bytes zeroed. The same mission start: START cannot open lb.3dG (its error arm, the program carries on) and rejects lb.3dT because its magic word is not '11' (the terrain reader's error arm); START then idles.
# expect-exit MPS_LOGO.EXE 255 100000
# expect-open lb.wld START.EXE 1
# expect-open lb.3dT START.EXE 1
--damage
poke=18:FF:LABSLOGO.SS
--damage
remove:LB.3DG
--damage
poke=0:0000:LB.3DT
